        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>TC300 Series Global Door Controls Small Surface Mount Door Closer</b>\r\n<p>\r\nGlobal Series TC300 Series Door Closers are an economically priced door \r\ncloser for use on interior or lightweight exterior door applications. \r\nIts compact design has the features and appearance of a full size closer but requires less space on a door for \r\ninstallation, and provides complete functionality for any opening.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>The TC300 Series are commonly used on projects that specify multiple interior closers to address job conditions and budget concerns. \r\nThey are an excellent choice for hotels, condominiums, apartment complex and single-family residences.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nGlobal Series TC300 Door Closers are non handed and can be \r\nmounted on regular, top jamb or parallel arm installations. \r\nThey fit 6-3/8\" x 3/4\" mounting hole pattern and packaged complete with wood and machine screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 3 Spring tensions: Light #2, Medium #3, and Heavy #4.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nFeatures of the TC300 Door Coser:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed</li>\r\n<li>Aluminum Alloy Shell</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 6-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><b>Includes Parallel Mount Bracket</b></li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li>Grade 3 Certified</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications for TC302-PA  Light #2: </b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 137 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size: 32\" interior</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications for TC303-PA  Medium #3: </b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 155 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size: 36\" interior / 30\" exterior</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications for TC304-PA  Heavy #4: </b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 243 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size: 44\" interior / 36\" exterior</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>NOTE: the standard arm shown in the upper right product image is included, as well as the bracket below.</i>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/glo-tc300-bracket.jpg?v=1704354602\" width=\"450\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Closer Accessories and  Brackets\">\r\n</p>",
